#: geosight/data/models/context_layer.py:103
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The type of layer for this context layer.<br>For <b>ArcGIS</b>, put feature "
"server of REST. e.g : https://{host}/rest/services/{layer}/FeatureServer/1."
"<br>For <b>GeoJson</b>, put url of geojson.<br>For <b>Raster tile</b>, put "
"XYZ url.<br>For <b>Raster COG</b>, put url of cog.<br>For <b>Related table</"
"b>, select existing related table name.<br>For <b>Vector tile</b>, put XYZ "
"url.<br>For <b>Cloud native gis layer</b>, select the layer from cloud "
"native gis."
msgstr ""
"O tipo de camada para esta camada de contexto.<br>Para <b>ArcGIS</b>, "
"informe o Feature Server REST, ex.: https://{host}/rest/services/{layer}/"
"FeatureServer/1.<br>Para <b>GeoJson</b>, informe a URL do GeoJSON.<br>Para "
"<b>Raster tile</b>, informe a URL XYZ.<br>Para <b>Raster COG</b>, informe a "
"URL do COG.<br>Para <b>Related table</b>, selecione o nome de uma tabela "
"relacionada existente.<br>Para <b>Vector tile</b>, informe a URL XYZ."
"<br>Para <b>Cloud native gis layer</b>, selecione a camada do cloud native "
"gis."

